codex
One premise is wrong: `swpctx` reads `apcb_asn` when saving the outgoing PCB, then loads the incoming ASN. That is real state handling, although it does not establish ASN-tagged caching. The logs match 5/7 → 7/7; I’m checking the cache structures and what the positive control can actually distinguish.
